title: "HackMatch — US-023: Team Private Coordination Workspace — Interaction Sequence"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f1e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"diagramMarginX":25,"diagramMarginY":18,"actorMargin":35,"width":165,"height":62,"boxMargin":8,"messageMargin":25,"noteMargin":10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Member as Confirmed team member
    participant UI as PrivateCoordinationWorkspace
    participant API as Express team workspace routes
    participant Svc as Workspace service and privacy projection
    participant Repo as Workspace repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL RPCs and tables

    Member->>UI: Open locked-team workspace
    UI->>API: GET /api/teams/:teamId/workspace
    API->>API: Require Firebase, MFA, active verified PART
    API->>Svc: Load workspace for actor and team
    Svc->>Svc: Require locked roster and confirmed membership
    alt Not locked, unrelated, ADMIN, or inactive account
        Svc-->>UI: Safe 403 or 404 with no workspace data
        UI-->>Member: Access/error state with reload where applicable
    else Authorized member
        Svc->>Repo: Load links, note, revisions, and teammate profiles
        Repo->>DB: Query service-role-only tables
        DB-->>Svc: Workspace records
        Svc->>Svc: Project permitted contacts, pseudonymize former members,<br/>scrub emails and authentication fields
        Svc-->>UI: No-store private workspace view
        UI-->>Member: Contacts, links, shared note, and revision history
    end

    opt Team owner replaces shared links
        Member->>UI: Validate up to 10 HTTPS links
        UI->>API: PUT /api/teams/:teamId/workspace/links
        API->>Svc: Owner-authorized replacement
        Svc->>Repo: replaceLinksForTeam(...)
        Repo->>DB: Atomic replace_team_workspace_links RPC
        DB-->>UI: Updated safe link list
    end

    opt Any confirmed member saves shared note
        Member->>UI: Submit sanitized Markdown and expectedVersion
        UI->>API: PUT /api/teams/:teamId/workspace/note
        API->>Svc: saveWorkspaceSharedNote(...)
        Svc->>Svc: Sanitize scripts, handlers, and unsafe links
        Svc->>Repo: saveNoteWithOptimisticLock(...)
        Repo->>DB: Atomic save_team_workspace_note RPC
        DB->>DB: Advisory lock, compare version,<br/>save note and append revision
        alt Version matches
            DB-->>UI: New note, revision, and history
            UI-->>Member: Success and updated preview
        else Stale expectedVersion
            DB-->>Svc: WORKSPACE_NOTE_CONFLICT
            Svc-->>UI: 409 with latest safe note and revisions
            UI-->>Member: Preserve unsaved draft and offer load latest
        end
    end

